  "description": "Strongly typed .NET configuration files for JSON, YAML, TOML 1.1, and INI. Synchronous and asynchronous APIs, model defaults and validation, DPAPI / AES-GCM field encryption, and DI / Options / Host integration. Includes a source generator. Supports .NET Framework 4.6.2–4.8.1 and .NET 8 / 9 / 10, with Native AOT on modern .NET.",
  "id": "Confio",
  "isPrerelease": false,
