  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds configurable file encodings through ConfigurationFileOptions.Encoding, Unicode BOM detection, code-page support, and lossless conversion checks. The sample includes encoding selection and file previews. Fixes a Windows sharing conflict during concurrent automatic AES key initialization. Release notes: https://github.com/zeekmeta/Confio/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
